# Purpose

Motion is communication.

Animations exist to explain change, reinforce hierarchy and provide confidence.

Motion must never exist solely because it looks impressive.

Every animation answers one question:

"What changed?"

---

# Motion Philosophy

Aura should feel alive.

Not animated.

Users should rarely notice individual animations.

Instead they should notice that everything feels smooth.

The interface should feel closer to liquid than machinery.

