---

# Interruptibility

Users remain in control.

Every animation must be interruptible.

Example

While opening a Room

↓

User taps Back

↓

Animation reverses immediately.

Never force users to wait.

---

# Progressive Motion

Complex operations should reveal progress naturally.

Instead of

Loading...

Use

Device discovered

↓

Authenticating

↓

Reading capabilities

↓

Ready

Motion should explain each stage.

