Background animations pause while higher-priority animations occur.

---

# Accessibility

When Reduce Motion is enabled

Replace movement with

Opacity

Scale

Crossfade

Never remove feedback entirely.

---

# Performance

Target

120 FPS on ProMotion devices

Minimum

60 FPS

Dropped frames should be considered bugs.

---

# Developer Rules

Never hardcode durations.

Never hardcode curves.

Use AuraAnimation tokens.

Avoid nested animations.

Avoid simultaneous competing animations.

Always test on real hardware.

---

# Motion Checklist

Does the animation explain something?

Does it reinforce hierarchy?

Can it be interrupted?

Does it feel native?

Would it still feel elegant after years of use?

If any answer is "No"

Remove or redesign the animation.

---

# Golden Rule

The best animation is the one users remember as a feeling,

not as an animation.

